114	     *  of time), rounded to two decimals by the claim's rounding (see {@link #rounding}), and at least the sheet's floor (a correction's, a
115	     *  negative amount's, has no floor); null when no rate applies. */
116	    public BigDecimal due(String sheetId, Claim claim) {
